00:08:31.511 --> 00:08:33.312
in terms of 2020

00:08:33.312 --> 00:08:34.347
election interference,

00:08:34.347 --> 00:08:35.915
in terms of efforts

00:08:35.915 --> 00:08:36.516
to overturn

00:08:36.516 --> 00:08:38.050
the results of the 2020 election

00:08:38.050 --> 00:08:39.552
that's still going on right now.

00:08:42.054 --> 00:08:42.889
Very much so.

00:08:42.889 --> 00:08:43.489
And that grand

00:08:43.489 --> 00:08:45.324
jury was meeting yesterday.

00:08:45.324 --> 00:08:47.493
We believe they heard from Newt Gingrich

00:08:47.493 --> 00:08:48.394
yesterday

00:08:48.394 --> 00:08:49.529
in that secret

00:08:49.529 --> 00:08:51.531
proceeding in Washington, D.C.

00:08:51.531 --> 00:08:53.332
and that there are others

00:08:53.332 --> 00:08:54.700
witnesses that I've been hearing

00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:56.969
about coming in the coming days

00:08:56.969 --> 00:08:58.838
who've been asked by investigators

00:08:58.838 --> 00:09:00.706
to speak in that investigation as well,

00:09:00.706 --> 00:09:02.975
so that January six investigation around

00:09:02.975 --> 00:09:04.443
what happened at the White House

00:09:04.443 --> 00:09:05.945
after the 20, 20 election

00:09:05.945 --> 00:09:07.647
leading up to the attack on the Capitol

00:09:07.647 --> 00:09:08.814
on January six.

00:09:08.814 --> 00:09:11.450
Very much a real investigation

00:09:11.651 --> 00:09:13.452
that continues on

00:09:13.452 --> 00:09:15.121
with a very active grand jury

00:09:15.121 --> 00:09:16.289
in the Washington, D.C.

00:09:16.289 --> 00:09:17.056
federal courthouse.

